      "summary": "Prepares presentation synchronization for submission of the acquired frame.",
      "details": "Prepares the currently acquired frame's presentation synchronization before queue submission; it does not replace resource-state transitions recorded by command lists. Call it in the required acquire, record, prepare-submit, submit, and present order. The operation is void and provides no immediate portable error result; observable failures surface later through Present, GetError, or the configured diagnostic callback.",
      "source": "Source/ArdaBackend/Public/ArdaSwapChain.h",
      "params": [],
      "returns": "No value.",
      "ownership": "Does not transfer ownership. It operates on the swap chain's currently acquired frame and its presentation state.",
