      "signature": "[[nodiscard]] FArdaShaderDirectoryStatus ResolveVirtualShaderSource( const eastl::string& VirtualPath, std::filesystem::path& OutPhysicalPath)",
      "summary": "Resolves a virtual shader path through the frozen manifest.",
      "details": "Resolves a normalized full virtual shader path only through the frozen manifest and writes the matching physical source path on success.",
