      "summary": "Virtual components are restricted to portable ASCII letters, digits, underscore, hyphen, and period.",
      "details": "Validates portable ASCII virtual components and supported shader paths, scans every registration, and atomically publishes a deterministic immutable manifest. Backend initialization invokes this operation automatically before device creation.",
